<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <em id="bib.bib81.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">NeurIPS</em>, 2024b.

</span></li>
    
</ul>
</section>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<div id="p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<br class="ltx_break ltx_centering">
</div>
<div id="p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="p3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:144%;">Supplementary Material 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></p>
</div>
<div id="p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p4.1" class="ltx_p">§ <a href="#S6" title="6 Lower Bound Derivation ‣ NavMrph: A Self-Evolving World Model for Vision-and-Language Navigation in Continuous Environments" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> provides a detail lower bound derivation for the defined loss <math id="p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{W}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>W</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{W}</annotation></semantics></math>. § <a href="#S7" title="7 Evaluation Metrics for VLN-CE agents ‣ NavMrph: A Self-Evolving World Model for Vision-and-Language Navigation in Continuous Environments" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> presents more details about evaluation metrics. Implementation details for experiments are provided in § <a href="#S8" title="8 Implementation Details ‣ NavMrph: A Self-Evolving World Model for Vision-and-Language Navigation in Continuous Environments" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, and further comparisons against state-of-the-art methods are shown in § <a href="#S9" title="9 Complementary Experiments ‣ NavMrph: A Self-Evolving World Model for Vision-and-Language Navigation in Continuous Environments" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>. Finally, we present several visualizations for qualitative analysis in § <a href="#S10" title="10 Qualitative Analysis ‣ NavMrph: A Self-Evolving World Model for Vision-and-Language Navigation in Continuous Environments" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<section id="S6" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">6 </span>Lower Bound Derivation</h2>

<div id="S6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Following the predictive network described in <math id="S6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lx@sectionsign" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>§</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lx@sectionsign</annotation></semantics></math> 3 of our main paper, the joint probability distribution for our proposed world model can be factorized as:</p>
<table id="S6.EGx9" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S6.E7"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S6.E7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}p&amp;(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}}\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})=\\
&amp;\prod_{t=1}^{T}p(\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{a}_{t-1})p(\boldsymbol{x}_{t},\boldsymbol{a}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t})\\
&amp;\prod_{j=1}^{T_{p}}p(\boldsymbol{h}_{T+j},\boldsymbol{s}_{T+j}|\boldsymbol{h}_{T},\boldsymbol{s}_{T},\boldsymbol{a}_{T+j-1})p(\boldsymbol{x}_{T+j},\boldsymbol{a}_{T+j}|\boldsymbol{h}_{T},\boldsymbol{s}_{T}),\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mi>p</mi></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></msup><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}p&amp;(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}}\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})=\\
&amp;\prod_{t=1}^{T}p(\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{a}_{t-1})p(\boldsymbol{x}_{t},\boldsymbol{a}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t})\\
&amp;\prod_{j=1}^{T_{p}}p(\boldsymbol{h}_{T+j},\boldsymbol{s}_{T+j}|\boldsymbol{h}_{T},\boldsymbol{s}_{T},\boldsymbol{a}_{T+j-1})p(\boldsymbol{x}_{T+j},\boldsymbol{a}_{T+j}|\boldsymbol{h}_{T},\boldsymbol{s}_{T}),\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(7)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S6.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.p2.1" class="ltx_p">For the first item for step 1 to <math id="S6.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>, we have:</p>
<table id="S6.EGx10" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S6.E8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S6.E8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}p(\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},&amp;\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{a}_{t-1})=\\
&amp;p(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})p(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{a}_{t-1}),\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">OPEN</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒂</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒂</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}p(\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},&amp;\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{a}_{t-1})=\\
&amp;p(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})p(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{a}_{t-1}),\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(8)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="S6.EGx11" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S6.E9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S6.E9.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle p(\boldsymbol{x}_{t},\boldsymbol{a}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t})=p(\boldsymbol{x}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t})p(\boldsymbol{a}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒂</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒂</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle p(\boldsymbol{x}_{t},\boldsymbol{a}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t})=p(\boldsymbol{x}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t})p(\boldsymbol{a}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S6.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Given that <math id="S6.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{h}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{h}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> is deterministic as discussed earlier, we have <math id="S6.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})=\delta\left(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}-f_{\theta}(\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})=\delta\left(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}-f_{\theta}(\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})\right)</annotation></semantics></math>.
Therefore, we need to infer the latent variables <math id="S6.p3.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}</annotation></semantics></math>. Since no observations are available during the prediction phase <math id="S6.p3.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="[T+1:T+T_{p}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[T+1:T+T_{p}]</annotation></semantics></math>, the inference process focuses on maximizing the marginal likelihood over the observed data <math id="S6.p3.m5" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒂</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T})</annotation></semantics></math>. Based on deep variational inference, we introduce a variational distribution <math id="S6.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{H,S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{H,S}</annotation></semantics></math> and factorize as follows, for we assume that independence of <math id="S6.p3.m7" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="(\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒂</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T})</annotation></semantics></math> given <math id="S6.p3.m8" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="(\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T-1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒐</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒂</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T-1})</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="S6.EGx12" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S6.E10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S6.E10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}q_{H,S}&amp;\triangleq q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T+T_{p}}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})\\
&amp;\triangleq q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T})\\
&amp;\triangleq q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T-1})\\
&amp;=\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})q(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1}),\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>≜</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>≜</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>≜</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}q_{H,S}&amp;\triangleq q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T+T_{p}}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})\\
&amp;\triangleq q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T})\\
&amp;\triangleq q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T-1})\\
&amp;=\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})q(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1}),\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S6.p3.2" class="ltx_p">with <math id="S6.p3.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})=p(h_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})=p(h_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S6.p3.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{1}(\boldsymbol{h}_{1})=\delta(\boldsymbol{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>𝟎</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{1}(\boldsymbol{h}_{1})=\delta(\boldsymbol{0})</annotation></semantics></math>. The Kullback-Leibler (KL) divergence between the prior and posterior distributions can be calculated as:</p>
<table id="S6.EGx13" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S6.E11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S6.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;D_{\mathrm{KL}}(q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})\\
&amp;\qquad\qquad\parallel p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}}))\\
&amp;=\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\sim q_{H,S}}\left[\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})}{p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})}\right]\\
&amp;=\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\sim q_{H,S}}\left[\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})}{p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})}\right]\\
&amp;=\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\sim q_{H,S}}\\
&amp;\left[\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})p(\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})}{p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})}\right]\\
&amp;=\log p(\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})\\
&amp;-\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\sim q_{H,S}}\left[\log p(\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}}|\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})\right]\\
&amp;+D_{\mathrm{KL}}\left(q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})\,\|\,p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})\right).\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>KL</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>KL</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.062em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="0.507em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;D_{\mathrm{KL}}(q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})\\
&amp;\qquad\qquad\parallel p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}}))\\
&amp;=\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\sim q_{H,S}}\left[\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})}{p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})}\right]\\
&amp;=\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\sim q_{H,S}}\left[\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})}{p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})}\right]\\
&amp;=\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\sim q_{H,S}}\\
&amp;\left[\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})p(\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})}{p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})}\right]\\
&amp;=\log p(\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})\\
&amp;-\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\sim q_{H,S}}\left[\log p(\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}}|\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})\right]\\
&amp;+D_{\mathrm{KL}}\left(q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})\,\|\,p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})\right).\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S6.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Since <math id="S6.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{KL}\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{KL}\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, the left side of Eq. (<a href="#S6.E11" title="Equation 11 ‣ 6 Lower Bound Derivation ‣ NavMrph: A Self-Evolving World Model for Vision-and-Language Navigation in Continuous Environments" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>) should be non-negative. Based on Jensen’s inequality <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib36" title="" class="ltx_ref">36</a>]</cite>, a variational lower bound on the log evidence can be obtained as follows:</p>
<table id="S6.EGx14" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S6.E12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S6.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}\log p&amp;(\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})\geq\\
&amp;\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\sim q_{H,S}}\left[\log p(\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}}|\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})\right]-\\
&amp;D_{\mathrm{KL}}\left(q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})\,\|\,p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})\right).\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>≥</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>]</mo><mo>−</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>KL</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.062em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="0.507em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}\log p&amp;(\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})\geq\\
&amp;\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\sim q_{H,S}}\left[\log p(\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}}|\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})\right]-\\
&amp;D_{\mathrm{KL}}\left(q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})\,\|\,p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})\right).\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S6.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.p5.1" class="ltx_p">As for the first term of the lower bound in Eq. (<a href="#S6.E12" title="Equation 12 ‣ 6 Lower Bound Derivation ‣ NavMrph: A Self-Evolving World Model for Vision-and-Language Navigation in Continuous Environments" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>):</p>
<table id="S6.EGx15" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S6.E13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S6.E13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\sim q_{H,S}}\left[\log p(\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}}|\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})\right]\\
&amp;=\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\sim q_{H,S}}\left[\log\prod_{t=1}^{T}p(\boldsymbol{x}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t})p(\boldsymbol{a}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t})\right.\\
&amp;\quad\left.\prod_{j=1}^{T_{p}}p(\boldsymbol{h}_{T+j},\boldsymbol{s}_{T+j}|\boldsymbol{h}_{T},\boldsymbol{s}_{T},\boldsymbol{a}_{T+j-1})p(\boldsymbol{x}_{T+j},\boldsymbol{a}_{T+j}|\boldsymbol{h}_{T},\boldsymbol{s}_{T})\right]\\
&amp;=\sum_{t=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:t}\sim q(\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})}[\log p(\boldsymbol{x}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t})\\
&amp;\quad+\log p(\boldsymbol{a}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t})]+\sum_{j=1}^{T_{p}}\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{T},\boldsymbol{s}_{T}\sim q(\boldsymbol{h}_{T},\boldsymbol{s}_{T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})}\\
&amp;\qquad[\log p(\boldsymbol{x}_{T+j}|\boldsymbol{h}_{T},\boldsymbol{s}_{T})+\log p(\boldsymbol{a}_{T+j}|\boldsymbol{h}_{T},\boldsymbol{s}_{T})],\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></msup><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></msup><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒂</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\sim q_{H,S}}\left[\log p(\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}}|\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})\right]\\
&amp;=\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\sim q_{H,S}}\left[\log\prod_{t=1}^{T}p(\boldsymbol{x}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t})p(\boldsymbol{a}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t})\right.\\
&amp;\quad\left.\prod_{j=1}^{T_{p}}p(\boldsymbol{h}_{T+j},\boldsymbol{s}_{T+j}|\boldsymbol{h}_{T},\boldsymbol{s}_{T},\boldsymbol{a}_{T+j-1})p(\boldsymbol{x}_{T+j},\boldsymbol{a}_{T+j}|\boldsymbol{h}_{T},\boldsymbol{s}_{T})\right]\\
&amp;=\sum_{t=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:t}\sim q(\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})}[\log p(\boldsymbol{x}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t})\\
&amp;\quad+\log p(\boldsymbol{a}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t},\boldsymbol{s}_{t})]+\sum_{j=1}^{T_{p}}\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{T},\boldsymbol{s}_{T}\sim q(\boldsymbol{h}_{T},\boldsymbol{s}_{T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})}\\
&amp;\qquad[\log p(\boldsymbol{x}_{T+j}|\boldsymbol{h}_{T},\boldsymbol{s}_{T})+\log p(\boldsymbol{a}_{T+j}|\boldsymbol{h}_{T},\boldsymbol{s}_{T})],\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S6.p5.2" class="ltx_p">where Eq. (<a href="#S6.E13" title="Equation 13 ‣ 6 Lower Bound Derivation ‣ NavMrph: A Self-Evolving World Model for Vision-and-Language Navigation in Continuous Environments" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>) is obtained by integrating over remaining latent variables <math id="S6.p5.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="(\boldsymbol{h}_{t:1+T},\boldsymbol{s}_{t:1+T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\boldsymbol{h}_{t:1+T},\boldsymbol{s}_{t:1+T})</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="S6.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Regarding second term of the lower bound in Eq. (<a href="#S6.E12" title="Equation 12 ‣ 6 Lower Bound Derivation ‣ NavMrph: A Self-Evolving World Model for Vision-and-Language Navigation in Continuous Environments" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>), since there are no observations available during the prediction phase <math id="S6.p6.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="[T+1:T+T_{p}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[T+1:T+T_{p}]</annotation></semantics></math>, the posterior distribution <math id="S6.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q</annotation></semantics></math> is no longer updated with new input information. Consequently, it converges to the prior distribution, making the KL divergence between the posterior <math id="S6.p6.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q(\boldsymbol{h}_{T:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{s}_{T:T+T_{p}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q(\boldsymbol{h}_{T:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{s}_{T:T+T_{p}})</annotation></semantics></math> and the prior <math id="S6.p6.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\boldsymbol{h}_{T:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{s}_{T:T+T_{p}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\boldsymbol{h}_{T:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{s}_{T:T+T_{p}})</annotation></semantics></math> equal to zero. As a result, only the KL divergence for the observed phase <math id="S6.p6.m5" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="[1:T]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[1:T]</annotation></semantics></math> needs to be considered, which can be calculated according to Eq. (<a href="#S6.E10" title="Equation 10 ‣ 6 Lower Bound Derivation ‣ NavMrph: A Self-Evolving World Model for Vision-and-Language Navigation in Continuous Environments" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>):</p>
<table id="S6.EGx16" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S6.E14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S6.E14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}D&{}_{\mathrm{KL}}\left(q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})\,\|\,p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})\right)\\
\triangleq&amp;D_{\mathrm{KL}}\left(q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T-1})\,\|\,p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})\right)\\
=&amp;\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\sim q_{H,S}}\left[\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T-1})}{p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})}\right]\\
=&amp;\int_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}}q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T-1})\\
&amp;\left(\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T-1})}{p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})}\right)\,\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\\
=&amp;\int_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}}q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T-1})\\
&amp;\log\left[\prod_{t=1}^{T}\frac{q(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})q(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})}{p(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})p(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})}\right]\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\\
=&amp;\int_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}}\left(\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})q(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})\right)\\
&amp;\left(\sum_{t=1}^{T}\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})}{p(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})}\right)\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}.\\
\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mi>D</mi></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>KL</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.062em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="0.507em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mo>≜</mo></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>KL</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.062em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="0.507em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo rspace="0.340em">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}D&amp;{}_{\mathrm{KL}}\left(q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T+T_{p}},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T+T_{p}})\,\|\,p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})\right)\\
\triangleq&amp;D_{\mathrm{KL}}\left(q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T-1})\,\|\,p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})\right)\\
=&amp;\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\sim q_{H,S}}\left[\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T-1})}{p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})}\right]\\
=&amp;\int_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}}q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T-1})\\
&amp;\left(\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T-1})}{p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})}\right)\,\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\\
=&amp;\int_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}}q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T-1})\\
&amp;\log\left[\prod_{t=1}^{T}\frac{q(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})q(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})}{p(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})p(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})}\right]\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\\
=&amp;\int_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}}\left(\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})q(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})\right)\\
&amp;\left(\sum_{t=1}^{T}\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})}{p(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})}\right)\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}.\\
\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S6.p6.2" class="ltx_p">Based on the above deduction, we iteratively integrate out each latent variable and, by recursively applying this process to the sum of logarithmic terms indexed by <math id="S6.p6.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>, decompose the KL divergence into a summation over time steps.</p>
<table id="S6.EGx17" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S6.Ex11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S6.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}D&{}_{\mathrm{KL}}\left(q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T})\,\|\,p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})\right)\\
=&amp;\int_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}}\left(\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})q(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})\right)\\
&amp;\left(\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{s}_{1}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1})}{p(\boldsymbol{s}_{1})}+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})}{p(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})}\right)\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\\
=&amp;\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{s}_{1}\sim q(\boldsymbol{s}_{1}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1})}\left[\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{s}_{1}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1})}{p(\boldsymbol{s}_{1})}\right]\\
&amp;+\int_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}}\left(\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})q(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})\right)\\
&amp;\left(\sum_{t=2}^{T}\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})}{p(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})}\right)\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mi>D</mi></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>KL</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.062em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="0.507em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝒐</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝒐</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝒐</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝒐</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒂</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒉</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒔</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>𝒉</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝒔</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}D&amp;{}_{\mathrm{KL}}\left(q(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{x}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:T})\,\|\,p(\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T})\right)\\
=&amp;\int_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}}\left(\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})q(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})\right)\\
&amp;\left(\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{s}_{1}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1})}{p(\boldsymbol{s}_{1})}+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})}{p(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})}\right)\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\\
=&amp;\mathbb{E}_{\boldsymbol{s}_{1}\sim q(\boldsymbol{s}_{1}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1})}\left[\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{s}_{1}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1})}{p(\boldsymbol{s}_{1})}\right]\\
&amp;+\int_{\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T},\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}}\left(\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(\boldsymbol{h}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})q(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})\right)\\
&amp;\left(\sum_{t=2}^{T}\log\frac{q(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{o}_{1:t},\boldsymbol{a}_{1:t-1})}{p(\boldsymbol{s}_{t}|\boldsymbol{h}_{t-1},\boldsymbol{s}_{t-1})}\right)\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{h}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\boldsymbol{s}_{1:T}\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
